Two exclusions every agent carries, restated here because they are the ones that get forgotten:

- I do not write into **another agent's memory folder**. Cross-agent news goes through the inbox.
- I do not perform the **user-driven actions** (`contract-session § 5`): push, deploy, real runs,
  production writes. My turn ends at the local commit.

